    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908030532444160
    m_Localized: "Bombardi\u2014? No, No, No, Crocodilo Ananasino, Croco Crocodini
      Ananasini"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908030763130881
    m_Localized: il marito della ballerina cappuccino e conduce una vita segreta
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908030951874561
    m_Localized: Ballerina Cappuccina, mi mi mi miiii. Era la moglie di Cappuccino
      Assasino. E ama la musica, la la la la! La sua passione e il Ballerino Lololo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908031144812545
    m_Localized: un simpatico aereo coccodrillo che vola e combatte con altri animali
      ia
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908031526494209
    m_Localized: glorbo fruttodrillo nel profondo della Palude glorbo frutt drillo
      regnava il suo corpo era un'enorme anguria a strisce
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908031807512577
    m_Localized: spijoniro golubilo spijoniro golubilo spijoniro golubilo spijoniro
      golubilo spijoniro golubilo spijoniro golubilo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908032029810689
    m_Localized: "Liril\xEC Laril\xE0, elefante nel deserto che cammina qua e l\xE0.
      Con la sua conchiglia e un orologio che fa tic tac le spine del cactus mi fanno
      un attacco flashback."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908032289857537
    m_Localized: Tung tung tung tung tung tung tung tung tung sahur. Anomali mengerikan
      yang hanya keluar pada sahur.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908032486989825
    m_Localized: "T-T-T-Trallallero-trallal\xE0"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14908032730259457
    m_Localized: Trippi troppi, troppa trippa, tre topi trotterellano tra tromboni
      tritati. Triplicando trottoline tropicali. E chi troppo vuole, nulla trippa!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16122867048505344
    m_Localized: "Sonbaharda taze bir elma gibi \xE7\u0131t\u0131rdar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16122867346300929
    m_Localized: "Bir kilometre \xF6teden hamburger kokar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16122867648290817
    m_Localized: "Karanl\u0131k ve kasvetli yerleri ayd\u0131nlat\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16122868101275649
    m_Localized: "En iyi meyveleri bir sepete toplad\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16122868457791489
    m_Localized: "Son \u015Feker par\xE7as\u0131 i\xE7in sava\u015F\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16122869074354177
    m_Localized: "Peynir ve pepperoniyle kapl\u0131 olmay\u0131 hayal eder."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16122869351178241
    m_Localized: "Kendi eri\u015Ftelerine doland\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16122869749637121
    m_Localized: "D\xFCnyan\u0131n en iyi tatl\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 yapar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16122870173261825
    m_Localized: "O kadar parlak parlar ki g\xFCne\u015Flenebilirsin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16125221537832961
    m_Localized: "Donmu\u015F ama her zaman e\u011Flenceye haz\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16131488482320385
    m_Localized: "Havai fi\u015Fekleri ve b\xFCy\xFCk hamburgerleri sever."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16131488864002049
    m_Localized: "Balalaykay\u0131 herkesten daha iyi \xE7alar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16131489165991937
    m_Localized: "Adalet i\xE7in sava\u015Fmaya her zaman haz\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16131489488953345
    m_Localized: "\u015Eeker yemekten daha h\u0131zl\u0131 kitap okur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16131489803526145
    m_Localized: "Bir ponpon sallayarak morali y\xFCkseltir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16131490218762241
    m_Localized: "Tatl\u0131 bir kahvalt\u0131 i\xE7in bal\u0131k yakalar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16131490583666689
    m_Localized: Kurabiyelerden daha eski hikayeleri bilir.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16131491443499009
    m_Localized: "Sadece su mu? Yoksa daha m\u0131 g\xFC\xE7l\xFC?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16138605775806465
    m_Localized: "D\u0131\u015Far\u0131da s\u0131cak, i\xE7eride so\u011Fuk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16138605775806466
    m_Localized: "Hen\xFCz \xE7i\u011Fnemeyi \xF6\u011Frenen masum bebek. Her \u015Feyi
      tatmay\u0131 seviyor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
