  - m_Id: 16286911449522176
    m_Localized: "G\xFCc\xFC her sava\u015Fla artan bir kahraman. Ger\xE7ek bir evren
      savunucusu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16286911986393089
    m_Localized: "B\xFCy\xFCk ba\u015Far\u0131lara ula\u015Fmay\u0131 hayal eden
      al\xE7akg\xF6n\xFCll\xFC ama kararl\u0131 bir kahraman."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16286912510681089
    m_Localized: "Elmalar\u0131 seven g\xF6r\xFCnmez bir canavar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16286913026580481
    m_Localized: "Sevdikleri i\xE7in son nefesine kadar sava\u015Fmaya haz\u0131r
      y\u0131lmaz bir k\u0131l\u0131\xE7 ustas\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
